      "category": "Emergencies",
      "pl": "Potrzebuję lekarza",
      "en": "I need a doctor",
      "level": 2,
      "gender": null,
      "emoji": "👨‍⚕️",
      "note": "The verb 'potrzebować' (to need) forces the next word into the Genitive case ('lekarz' -> 'lekarza')."
    },
    {
