      "pl": "Ukradli mi portfel",
      "en": "They stole my wallet",
      "level": 2,
      "gender": null,
      "emoji": "👛",
      "note": "Literally: 'They stole to me the wallet.' 'Ukradli' is the 3rd person plural past tense."
    },
    {
